   287|            <div class="highlight">
   288|                <strong>Complete IVF Package in China typically includes:</strong>
   289|                <ul style="margin: 15px 0 0 20px;">
   290|                    <li>Initial consultation and fertility assessment</li>
   291|                    <li>Ovarian stimulation monitoring (ultrasounds & blood tests)</li>
   292|                    <li>Egg retrieval procedure</li>
   293|                    <li>Laboratory fertilization (IVF or ICSI)</li>
   294|                    <li>Embryo culture (3-5 days)</li>
   295|                    <li>Embryo transfer</li>
   296|                    <li>Pregnancy test and early monitoring</li>
   297|                    <li>English-speaking coordinators</li>
   298|                </ul>
   299|            </div>
