   307|                    <tr>
   308|                        <th>Age Group</th>
   309|                        <th>China Top Clinics</th>
   310|                        <th>US Average</th>
   311|                        <th>UK Average</th>
   312|                    </tr>
   313|                </thead>
   314|                <tbody>
   315|                    <tr>
   316|                        <td>Under 35</td>
   317|                        <td>50-60%</td>
   318|                        <td>55%</td>
   319|                        <td>32%</td>
   320|                    </tr>
   321|                    <tr>
   322|                        <td>35-37</td>
   323|                        <td>40-50%</td>
   324|                        <td>41%</td>
   325|                        <td>27%</td>
   326|                    </tr>
   327|                    <tr>
   328|                        <td>38-40</td>
   329|                        <td>30-40%</td>
   330|                        <td>26%</td>
   331|                        <td>19%</td>
   332|                    </tr>
   333|                    <tr>
   334|                        <td>41-42</td>
   335|                        <td>20-25%</td>
   336|                        <td>13%</td>
   337|                        <td>11%</td>
   338|                    </tr>
   339|                </tbody>
   340|            </table>
   341|
   342|            <p><em>Note: Success rates vary by clinic and individual circumstances. These figures represent top-tier Chinese fertility centers.</em></p>
   343|
   344|            <h2>Top 5 IVF Centers in China for International Patients</h2>
   345|
   346|            <div class="hospital-card">
   347|                <h3>1. Peking University Third Hospital (PUTH) Reproductive Medicine Center - Beijing</h3>
   348|                <span class="tag">#1 IVF in China</span>
   349|                <span class="tag">Birthplace of Chinese IVF</span>
   350|                <span class="tag">JCI Accredited</span>
   351|                
   352|                <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><strong>Why patients choose it:</strong> PUTH is where China's first IVF baby was born in 1988. They perform over 20,000 IVF cycles annually with consistent top-tier success rates.</p>
   353|                
   354|                <p><strong>Specialties:</strong> Complex infertility cases, recurrent implantation failure, PGT (genetic testing), fertility preservation</p>
   355|                
   356|                <p><strong>Success rates:</strong> 55-60% for women under 35</p>
   357|                
   358|                <p><strong>Cost:</strong> $4,000 - $6,000 per cycle</p>
